  "description": "An HF channel simulator for measuring modems: the Watterson tapped-delay-line model of MIL-STD-188-110D Appendix E (Rayleigh-fading or static paths with a Gaussian Doppler spectrum, AWGN calibrated as SNR in a 3 kHz bandwidth, the ITU-R F.1487 Poor geometry) and impulse noise (static crashes) calibrated from a measured 40 m capture campaign. Extracted from the pdn-soundmodem packet-radio modem so every HF modem measured through it shares one definition.",
